<title>USA: Gaylord to buy a Nelson music unit.</title>
<headline>Gaylord to buy a Nelson music unit.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaylord Entertainment Co said on Thursday it signed a definitive agreement to buy all the assets of Thomas Nelson Inc's Word Records and Music for $110 million.</p>
</text>
